Subject: [PATCH 152/220] [ae-patch] Show every open pull request in the action
 dock, with its state and Update branch when behind

The dock listed only drafts and pull requests ready to merge, so one still running checks (or with conflicts, failed checks, a review pending, or behind main) had no line: asked to merge when ready, the user had nothing to watch. Each such pull request now gets a waiting line with the thread receipt's word and tone, after drafts and before deploys, and Update branch when GitHub allows it. It turns into the Merge line once ready. omnigent-ae, 2026-10-22.
